Hook payloads recorded from a real Claude Code 2.1.289 run (a logging wrapper
around `den hook`), then neutralised: ids are 00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000NN,
paths are under /home/user, the scratch directory is /tmp/scratch.
The *-reply.json file is what the hook printed for the plan. The sessions:
001 a command, 003 and 009 plans, 005 a question, 007 an idle agent.
Real timing: a permission_prompt Notification arrives about 6 s after a
PermissionRequest that is still held, an idle_prompt about 5 s after Stop,
and PreToolUse(AskUserQuestion) 60 ms before its PermissionRequest.
